%%label I. Molto moderato
%%note D. A theme of rising fourths and fifths, first in bare octaves, then harmonised; it grows to a climax for the brass and subsides.
X:1
T:Copland’s Missing Symphony
T:I. Molto moderato
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Aaron Copland
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Molto moderato" 1/4=66
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp pno [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
